<p class="has-text-align-left wp-block-paragraph">The first book in the trilogy, The Phoney War, starts the journey off, introducing the main characters and the plot, it is a lighter and slower paced read than the second two books, mainly concentrating on how everything starts, developing the plot, the characters, the science and the technology for the action in the second two.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">The paperbacks can be bought from Amazon (click the pictures above to re-direct) or if dead trees is not your thing then the whole book series is is also available as a single 370,000 word eBook using the links below:</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><a href="https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0GX2W2GR1?crid=1R6XM4SYT6RTO&amp;dib=eyJ2IjoiMSJ9.jEMPcKz_ukeWwYjB6GlRhMCe5v1sS-jOtFmXRkUZmN1bsZVvFocM-AYoeSC6p7PaXpi84CUF_OHHknH8k1I_c-roiWpdNFRva0jp8k5162Xn7J549Yj1PwOwa_j6CZVgVDi_Zh9J9DYba1IMbJzw0AH1KVzxKLXipGoNe2OrKs8IY1xG1v0EhgHm9a2YmTm3YRrttGAkaszqTaQz_FvrTSXky_ddZc3FHg-BeM2R60Q.MTSFONjozWO0MBBUnL9Pv7flXR7etpBGK7o5AukZ6wg&amp;dib_tag=se&amp;keywords=the+summer+of+reasoning&amp;qid=1776733510&amp;sprefix=the+summer+of+reasonin%2Caps%2C365&amp;sr=8-1#detailBullets_feature_div" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Amazon Kindle</a> &#8211; Note Amazon specify a minimum eBook price of $0.99</p>



